{:edb/db-before-t 1583 :edb/db-after-t 1584 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534896 50 #inst "2026-10-08T10:22:16.927Z" 13194139534896 true] [17592186096754 1020 #edb/ref 17592186318111 13194139534896 true] [17592186096754 1020 #edb/ref 17592186318118 13194139534896 true] [17592186096754 1020 #edb/ref 17592186318135 13194139534896 true] [17592186096755 1020 #edb/ref 17592186318125 13194139534896 true] [17592186096755 1020 #edb/ref 17592186318132 13194139534896 true] [17592186318111 1017 #edb/ref 17592186318112 13194139534896 true] [17592186318111 1089 "q-114551" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318111 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534896 true] [17592186318111 1100 "Calculate $\\int 9{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318111 1113 #uuid "ce56e920-7128-5cb4-b00f-1f6fa4cc6241" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318111 1145 "We will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x} \\\\ {v}^{′}=9{x}^{2}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int 9{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x=3{x}^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 9{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)(3{x}^{3})-\\int \\frac{3{x}^{3}}{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)-3\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-{x}^{3}+C \\\\  & ={x}^{3}(3\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-1)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an integral constant." 13194139534896 true] [17592186318112 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318113 13194139534896 true] [17592186318112 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318114 13194139534896 true] [17592186318112 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318115 13194139534896 true] [17592186318112 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318116 13194139534896 true] [17592186318112 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318117 13194139534896 true] [17592186318112 10