 {v}^{′}=2x\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int 2x\\,\\text{d}x={x}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 2x{log}_{5}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={log}_{5}⁡(x)({x}^{2})-\\int ({x}^{2})(\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡5})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={x}^{2}{log}_{5}⁡(x)-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\int x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={x}^{2}{log}_{5}⁡(x)-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-1)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an integral constant.\n\nNote that in the above calculation we used the change of base formula ${log}_{5}⁡x=\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}.$" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318120 13194139534896 true] [17592186318119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318121 13194139534896 true] [17592186318119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318122 13194139534896 true] [17592186318119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318123 13194139534896 true] [17592186318119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318124 13194139534896 true] [17592186318119 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534896 true] [17592186318119 1041 "selection" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318119 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318123 13194139534896 true] [17592186318119 1110 #uuid "7acf4f14-2c9b-549e-a3ae-d4bcdf126fe0" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318120 1034 "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(3\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+2)+C" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318120 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318120 1111 #uuid "da149197-5612-5ca8-86b3-1fbf4db3a40d" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318121 1034 "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-1)+C" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318121 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318121 1111 #uuid "ceb697b9-60f8-51d7-956a-a84be5e2ce52" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318122 1034 "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(4\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-1)+C" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318122 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318122 1111 #uuid "f3b46d47-7665-5ce9-8b96-c7e983fb2070" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318123 1034 "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-1)+C" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318123 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318123 1111 #uuid "22e85555-3427-500f-b410-7a40d06d8667" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318124 1034 "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(4\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+1)+C" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318124 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318124 1111 #uuid "cd0015d3-2093-54f3-b9da-d1c42552e62b" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318125 1017 #edb/ref 17592186318126 13194139534896 true] [17592186318125 1089 "q-114679" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318125 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534896 true] [17592186318125 1100 "Evaluate ${\\int }_{1/2}^{1}{log}_{3}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318125 1113 #uuid "375fc98e-274f-5569-b040-d905f2154dcf" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318125 1145 "First, we write the integral as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1/2}^{1}{log}_{3}⁡(2x)\\text{d}x={\\int }_{1/2}^{1}\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{\\int }_{1/2}^{1}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)\\cdot 1\\cdot \\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x} \\\\ {v}^{′}=1\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int 1\\cdot \\,dx=x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1/2}^{1}{log}_{3}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{\\int }_{1/2}^{1}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)\\cdot 1\\cdot \\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{\\int }_{1/2}^{1}u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}[uv{|}_{1/2}^{1}-{\\int }_{1/2}^{1}v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}[x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x){|}_{1/2}^{1}-{\\int }_{1/2}^{1}x(\\frac{1}{x})\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}[1\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡(2\\cdot 1)-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2})-{\\int }_{1/2}^{1}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}[\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡1-x{|}_{1/2}^{1}\\,] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}[\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-0-(1-\\frac{1}{2})] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}[\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\frac{1}{2}] \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-1}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318126 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318127 13194139534896 true] [17592186318126 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318128 13194139534896 true] [17592186318126 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318129 13194139534896 true] [17592186318126 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318130 13194139534896 true] [17592186318126 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318131 13194139534896 true] [17592186318126 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534896 true] [17592186318126 1041 "selection" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318126 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318130 13194139534896 true] [17592186318126 1110 #uuid "f70f5b49-8ff0-5b61-a329-4e6974022274" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318127 1034 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318127 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318127 1111 #uuid "93259961-a3ca-5ac8-87a2-71a7cea6a409" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318128 1034 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+1}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318128 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318128 1111 #uuid "79a270bb-026c-5fe4-8af0-61cccf57f146" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318129 1034 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318129 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318129 1111 #uuid "8fca01a6-7b81-5aa9-a3e9-3e2ce16715ca" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318130 1034 "\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-1}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318130 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318130 1111 #uuid "9a7c4d64-f006-52ef-80d3-66b329b15866" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318131 1034 "\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318131 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318131 1111 #uuid "3c843b91-1290-5408-a9bc-054db86fb1c8" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318132 1017 #edb/ref 17592186318133 13194139534896 true] [17592186318132 1089 "q-350976" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318132 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534896 true] [17592186318132 1100 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{1/10}^{e/10}{log}_{5}⁡(10x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318132 1113 #uuid "27ff2eec-0dfe-5760-9612-9836e8485b37" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318132 1145 "First, we write the integral as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1/10}^{e/10}{log}_{5}⁡(10x)\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{1/10}^{e/10}{log}_{5}⁡(10x)\\cdot 1\\cdot \\text{d}x.\n$$\n\n \n\nWe will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={log}_{5}⁡(10x)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)} \\\\ {v}^{′}=1\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int 1\\cdot \\,dx=x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1/10}^{e/10}{log}_{5}⁡(10x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{1/10}^{e/10}u{v}^{′}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv{|}_{1/10}^{e/10}-{\\int }_{1/10}^{e/10}v{u}^{′}\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={log}_{5}⁡(10x)\\,(x){|}_{1/10}^{e/10}-{\\int }_{1/10}^{e/10}x(\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =[{log}_{5}⁡(10\\cdot \\frac{e}{10})\\,(\\frac{e}{10})-{log}_{5}⁡(10\\cdot \\frac{1}{10})\\,(\\frac{1}{10})]-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}{\\int }_{1/10}^{e/10}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{e}{10}{log}_{5}⁡(e)-\\frac{1}{10}{log}_{5}⁡(1)-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}x{|}_{1/10}^{e/10} \\\\  & =\\frac{e}{10}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}(\\frac{e}{10}-\\frac{1}{10}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318133 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318134 13194139534896 true] [17592186318133 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534896 true] [17592186318133 1041 "field-1" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318133 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318134 13194139534896 true] [17592186318133 1110 #uuid "0fef215c-0706-5dad-8f91-d116ebf774f2" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318134 1034 "\\frac{1}{10\\ln(5)}" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318134 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318134 1111 #uuid "99d72006-1147-54ef-a872-623eea25df94" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318135 1017 #edb/ref 17592186318136 13194139534896 true] [17592186318135 1089 "q-78965" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318135 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534896 true] [17592186318135 1100 "Calculate $\\int \\frac{{log}_{3}⁡(2x)}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318135 1113 #uuid "93bebc99-8c33-52a3-9bef-f35a82e22b74" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318135 1145 "We will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={log}_{3}⁡(2x)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3} \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{log}_{3}⁡(2x)}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={log}_{3}⁡(2x)\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{x})-\\int (-\\frac{1}{x})(\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{{log}_{3}⁡(2x)}{x}-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\int -\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{{log}_{3}⁡(2x)}{x}-\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}-\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)+1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an integral constant.\n\nNote that in the above calculation we used the change of base formula ${log}_{3}⁡x=\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}.$" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318136 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318137 13194139534896 true] [17592186318136 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318138 13194139534896 true] [17592186318136 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318139 13194139534896 true] [17592186318136 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318140 13194139534896 true] [17592186318136 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318141 13194139534896 true] [17592186318136 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534896 true] [17592186318136 1041 "selection" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318136 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318139 13194139534896 true] [17592186318136 1110 #uuid "4fd5921f-d948-5b6b-8545-0d3414bc7aee" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318137 1034 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)+1}{{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+C" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318137 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318137 1111 #uuid "70c568a5-a3e4-5e3c-8389-21b2fda1d663" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318138 1034 "\\frac{1-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+C" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318138 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318138 1111 #uuid "1c99aafa-224f-5d81-9236-71a11ae98eb8" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318139 1034 "-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)+1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+C" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318139 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534896 true] [17592186318139 1111 #uuid "8b5c387e-ca59-526a-a6bd-5f717de0f97e" 13194139534896 true] [17592186318140 1034 